%% The Vivijure render pipeline, keyframe to film (vivijure-com#92).
%% Source of https://assets.skyphusion.net/vivijure/diagrams/render-pipeline.svg
%% Render: see diagrams/README.md. Each node is a render hook as vivijure-core
%% resolves it (docs/CORE-VS-MODULES.md); the module names are the ones the
%% page's pipeline steps name.
flowchart LR
  SB[Storyboard] --> KF[Keyframe<br/>SDXL]
  KF --> DLG[Dialogue<br/>per-character TTS]
  KF --> MB{{motion.backend}}
  MB -- own GPU --> LOC[LTX on 12GB<br/>CogVideoX on 16GB]
  MB -- cloud --> CLD[Kling / Seedance / Hailuo<br/>Veo / Vidu / Wan and more]
  subgraph FIN[finish chain, opt-in]
    RIFE[RIFE interpolate] --> UP[CUDA Real-ESRGAN upscale]
  end
  LOC --> RIFE
  CLD --> RIFE
  UP --> ASM[Gather + assemble<br/>keepClipAudio]
  DLG --> ASM
  SCORE[Score, opt-in<br/>music bed / TTS narration] --> MUX[Mux audio]
  ASM --> MUX
  MUX --> TTL[Title card, credits,<br/>subtitles]
  TTL --> FILM[film.mp4]
